        "Corojo 99 / Criollo 98 / San Andres — Robusto 5 × 54, Toro 6½ × 54, Double Toro 6 × 60. Launched at the 2015 IPCPR, made at Raíces Cubanas (Honduras); a value range aimed at under $7 retail",
        "Miami 8 & 11 Toro (2020 edition) — 6 × 52, $16, boxes of 10. Made at El Titan de Bronze in Miami with AGANORSA leaf; named after the corner of Miami's 8th Street and 11th Avenue, site of Pepín García's old factory",
        "88 Aniversario — Toro 6 × 52 and Figurado 6 × 60 (as reported). 2020, made at Tabacalera AJ Fernandez, Estelí, Nicaragua; Ecuadorian Habano wrapper, double binder of Nicaraguan Criollo and Corojo",
        "Barcelona — Robusto 5 × 50, Toro 6 × 52, Robusto Gordo 5 × 56. 2022, made at the Cosigna factory in Nicaragua, boxes of 20; Nicaraguan AGANORSA leaf, Corojo Rosado wrapper; for international markets (Germany, Latvia and others)",
        "Before Night Falls Robusto — 5 × 52, $12. 2025 PCA; made by Best Cigars S.A. (Yaxel Ortiz) in Nicaragua",
