        "Craft Series 'Roots' — 6 × 52. Shipped 12 August 2024, made at Joya de Nicaragua S.A. (Estelí); Ecuadorian Habano wrapper, Nicaraguan binder, fillers from Nicaragua, Brazil and the USA. $11 a cigar, $110 a box of ten; halfwheel overall score 81",
